WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.501 --> 00:00:10.904
.

00:00:08.735 --> 00:00:11.304
BRET: IT WAS UNSCHEDULED AND

00:00:11.037 --> 00:00:13.206
UNSCRIPTED.

00:00:11.438 --> 00:00:14.341
THE PRESS HAD TO SCRAMBLE TO

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:17.544
GET THESE SHOTS.

00:00:14.474 --> 00:00:18.311
JUST AFTER 6:00 P.M. ON MAY 29,

00:00:17.677 --> 00:00:20.480
1988 PRESIDENT RONALD REAGAN

00:00:18.445 --> 00:00:23.016
AND FIRST LADY NANCY EMERGED

00:00:20.614 --> 00:00:24.618
FROM THEIR LIMOUSINE IN THE

00:00:23.149 --> 00:00:25.518
HISTORIC SECTION OF MOSCOW.

00:00:24.751 --> 00:00:26.887
WORD THAT THE AMERICAN

00:00:25.652 --> 00:00:28.889
PRESIDENT HAD COME OUT TO MEET

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:30.290
THEM UNANNOUNCED INSTANTLY

00:00:29.022 --> 00:00:32.659
SPREAD, AND THOUSANDS OF

00:00:30.423 --> 00:00:32.993
RUSSIANS SURGED ONTO THE

00:00:32.792 --> 00:00:34.494
STREETS.

00:00:33.126 --> 00:00:36.029
DESPITE A GROWING WORRY, THINGS

00:00:34.628 --> 00:00:37.831
COULD SPIRAL OUT OF CONTROL,

00:00:36.162 --> 00:00:40.667
THE 77-YEAR-OLD REAGAN ACTUALLY

00:00:37.964 --> 00:00:44.337
CLIMBED ONTO A VEGETABLE CART

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:46.373
TO ADDRESS THE CROWD.

00:00:44.471 --> 00:00:47.574
REAGAN'S PRESS SECRETARY MARLIN

00:00:46.506 --> 00:00:50.777
FITZWATER THOUGHT THIS IS GOING

00:00:47.707 --> 00:00:51.945
TO BE A DISASTER OR BE THE

00:00:50.911 --> 00:00:53.179
GREATEST PERFORMANCE IN

00:00:52.078 --> 00:00:53.480
HISTORY.

00:00:53.313 --> 00:00:55.115
HELLO.

00:00:53.613 --> 00:00:57.017
I'M BRET BAIER, WHAT THE SCENE

00:00:55.248 --> 00:00:58.685
TURNED OUT TO BE WAS THE

00:00:57.150 --> 00:01:01.488
DRAMATIC OPENING ACT OF A CLASH

00:00:58.818 --> 00:01:02.722
OF IMAGES, WORDS AND IDEAS THAT

00:01:01.621 --> 00:01:04.324
SIGNALED TO THE WORLD THAT THE

00:01:02.856 --> 00:01:06.726
COLD WAR WAS ALL BUT ONE.

00:01:04.457 --> 00:01:08.028
I WRITE ABOUT IT IN MY NEW

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:08.962
BOOK, "THREE DAYS IN MOSCOW,"

00:01:08.161 --> 00:01:10.664
RONALD REAGAN AND THE FALL OF

00:01:09.095 --> 00:01:13.099
THE SOVIET EMPIRE.

00:01:10.797 --> 00:01:15.135
EPIC STORY WITH UNLIKELY HERO

00:01:13.233 --> 00:01:15.135
OR SO IT ONCE SEEMED.

00:01:24.945 --> 00:01:28.949
HARD TO BELIEVE BUT AS A YOUNG

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:31.384
MAN, THE GREATEST OF COLD

00:01:29.082 --> 00:01:33.453
WARRIORS WAS SO LEFT WING, THE

00:01:31.518 --> 00:01:34.754
FBI SUSPECTED HE WAS A

00:01:33.586 --> 00:01:39.092
COMMUNIST.

00:01:34.888 --> 00:01:41.094
IN 1946, COMMUNISTS AND THE

00:01:39.225 --> 00:01:42.829
SCREEN ACTORS GUILD THREATENED

00:01:41.227 --> 00:01:47.467
TO END REAGAN'S ACTING CAREER

00:01:42.963 --> 00:01:49.736
BY POURING ACID ON HIS FACE.

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:50.637
REAGAN BEGAN TO TAKE NOTICE OF

00:01:49.869 --> 00:01:52.572
COMMUNIST EXPANSION OVERSEAS.

00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:56.176
&gt;&gt; WE IN AMERICA HAVE MET SOME

00:01:52.706 --> 00:01:58.979
YEARS AGO A SIMILAR PROGRAM

00:01:56.309 --> 00:02:03.817
CALLED PRESSIONISM UNDER THE

00:01:59.112 --> 00:02:06.353
KAISER WEEK MET IT MORE

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:06.987
RECENTLY UNDER NAZISM UNDER

00:02:06.486 --> 00:02:09.322
HITLER AND THE NATIONAL

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:10.957
EXPANSION OF RUSSIA.

00:02:09.456 --> 00:02:12.058
BRET: FOR THE NEXT 40 YEARS HE

00:02:11.091 --> 00:02:14.394
WAS RELENTLESS.

00:02:12.192 --> 00:02:16.296
&gt;&gt; WE MET THE COMMUNIST

00:02:14.527 --> 00:02:18.164
CHALLENGE DEPENDS ON YOU.

00:02:16.429 --> 00:02:20.533
BRET: NO CRITIC WAS FORCEFUL,

00:02:18.298 --> 00:02:20.867
MORE UNCOMPROMISING THAN

00:02:20.667 --> 00:02:23.203
REAGAN.

00:02:23.336 --> 00:02:24.904
SECURITY, OUR FREEDOM FROM THE

00:02:24.104 --> 00:02:27.207
THREAT OF THE BOMB.

00:02:25.038 --> 00:02:29.609
BY COMMITTING IMMORALITY SO

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:31.277
GREAT AS SAYING TO A BILLION

00:02:29.743 --> 00:02:33.713
HUMAN BEINGS NOW ENSLAVED

00:02:31.411 --> 00:02:37.484
BEHIND THE IRON CURTAIN, GIVE

00:02:33.847 --> 00:02:38.685
UP DREAMS OF FREEDOM BECAUSE TO

00:02:37.617 --> 00:02:43.556
SAVE OUR OWN SKINS.

00:02:38.818 --> 00:02:45.825
BRET: IN THE 70s HE OPPOSED THE

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:46.159
NIXON-FORD-KISSINGER POLICY OF

00:02:45.959 --> 00:02:47.727
DETENTE.

00:02:46.292 --> 00:02:49.529
&gt;&gt; MY VIEW OF DETENTE IS ONE OF

00:02:47.861 --> 00:02:49.863
MAKING CONCESSIONS TO THE

00:02:49.662 --> 00:02:50.864
SOVIETS.

00:02:49.996 --> 00:02:52.899
WE GIVE THEM SOMETHING THEY

00:02:50.997 --> 00:02:54.334
WANT VERY BADLY.

00:02:53.033 --> 00:02:54.667
WE DON'T ASK ANYTHING IN

00:02:54.467 --> 00:02:56.569
RETURN.

00:02:54.801 --> 00:02:59.105
BRET: NEITHER THE SUMMITS MORE

00:02:56.703 --> 00:03:01.107
ARMS CONTROL TREATIES STOPPED

00:02:59.239 --> 00:03:03.977
THE SPREAD OF COMMUNISM AS

00:03:01.241 --> 00:03:05.979
AMERICA LOOKED TO BE SLOWLY

00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:07.447
LOSING THE COLD WAR.

00:03:06.112 --> 00:03:11.051
AFTER HIS LOSS TO GERALD FORD

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:11.718
IN 1976, REAGAN SPOKE MOVING

00:03:11.184 --> 00:03:15.288
ABOUT THE STAKES.

00:03:11.851 --> 00:03:17.791
NOT SIMPLY THE FUTURE OF

00:03:15.422 --> 00:03:18.224
CIVILIZATION, THE SURVIVAL OF

00:03:17.924 --> 00:03:21.428
CIVILIZATION.

00:03:18.358 --> 00:03:23.730
&gt;&gt; SOMEONE ASKED ME TO WRITE A

00:03:21.561 --> 00:03:24.531
LETTER FOR A TIME CAPSULE THAT

00:03:23.863 --> 00:03:26.399
IS GOING TO BE OPENED IN LOS

00:03:24.664 --> 00:03:28.234
ANGELES 100 YEARS FROM NOW.

00:03:26.533 --> 00:03:29.402
I SAID TO MYSELF WE LIVE IN A

00:03:28.368 --> 00:03:31.137
WORLD WHICH THE GREAT POWERS

00:03:29.536 --> 00:03:31.771
HAVE AIMED AT EACH OTHER

00:03:31.271 --> 00:03:32.639
HORRIBLE MISSILES OF

00:03:31.905 --> 00:03:34.340
DESTRUCTION THAT CAN IN A

00:03:32.772 --> 00:03:36.443
MATTER OF MINUTES ARRIVE IN

00:03:34.474 --> 00:03:36.910
EACH OTHER'S COUNTRY AND

00:03:36.576 --> 00:03:37.911
DESTROY.

00:03:37.043 --> 00:03:39.646
THOSE WHO WOULD READ THIS

00:03:38.044 --> 00:03:40.880
LETTER 100 YEARS FROM NOW, WILL

00:03:39.779 --> 00:03:42.415
KNOW WHETHER THOSE MISSILES

00:03:41.014 --> 00:03:45.318
WERE FIRED.

00:03:42.549 --> 00:03:46.519
THEY WILL KNOW WHETHER WE MET

00:03:45.452 --> 00:03:48.121
OUR CHALLENGE?

00:03:46.653 --> 00:03:50.290
BRET: FORD HIMSELF LOST TO

00:03:48.254 --> 00:03:53.460
JIMMY CARTER WHILE THE SOVIETS

00:03:50.423 --> 00:03:54.094
ADDED SATELLITE STATES IN ASIA,

00:03:53.593 --> 00:03:57.697
AFRICA AND SOUTH AMERICA.

00:03:54.227 --> 00:04:00.533
[CHEERS]

00:03:57.831 --> 00:04:02.001
WHEN REAGAN RAN AGAIN IN 1980,

00:04:00.667 --> 00:04:03.770
HIS ANTI-COMMUNISM SEEMED TO

00:04:02.135 --> 00:04:04.070
MANY OUT OF STEP WITH THE

00:04:03.903 --> 00:04:06.639
TIMES.

00:04:04.204 --> 00:04:08.274
BUT HE WON IN A LANDSLIDE.

00:04:06.773 --> 00:04:11.411
USING HIS FIRST PRESS

00:04:08.408 --> 00:04:12.946
CONFERENCE AS PRESIDENT TO,

00:04:11.544 --> 00:04:15.215
AGAIN, DENOUNCE COMMUNISM.

00:04:13.079 --> 00:04:17.917
&gt;&gt; MR. PRESIDENT, WHAT DO YOU

00:04:15.348 --> 00:04:19.819
SEE AS THE LONG RANGE

00:04:18.051 --> 00:04:22.188
INTENTIONS OF THE SOVIET UNION.

00:04:19.953 --> 00:04:23.523
&gt;&gt; I KNOW OF NO LEADER OF THE

00:04:22.322 --> 00:04:26.960
SOVIET UNION THAT HAS NOT MORE

00:04:23.656 --> 00:04:27.727
THAN ONE REPEATED THEIR

00:04:27.093 --> 00:04:31.097
DETERMINATION THAT THEIR GOAL

00:04:27.861 --> 00:04:34.801
MUST BE THE PROMOTION OF WORLD

00:04:31.231 --> 00:04:37.704
REVOLUTION AND A ONE WORLD,

00:04:34.934 --> 00:04:39.239
SOCIALIST OR COMMUNIST, STATE.

00:04:37.837 --> 00:04:40.206
BRET: AN ASSASSINATION ATTEMPT

00:04:39.372 --> 00:04:41.608
INTENSIFIED HIS ZEAL, NOT

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:43.843
MERELY TO FIGHT THE COLD WAR,

00:04:41.741 --> 00:04:46.579
BUT TO WIN IT.

00:04:43.977 --> 00:04:48.548
HE AND POPE JOHN PAUL II WHO

00:04:46.713 --> 00:04:49.749
MIRACULOUSLY SURVIVED AN

00:04:48.681 --> 00:04:51.951
ASSASSIN'S BULLET SIX WEEKS

00:04:49.883 --> 00:04:53.753
AFTER REAGAN AGREED THAT GOD

00:04:52.085 --> 00:04:56.823
SPARED THEM SO THEY COULD END

00:04:53.887 --> 00:04:58.324
COMMUNISM AND COLLAPSE THE

00:04:56.956 --> 00:05:00.593
SOVIET UNION.

00:04:58.458 --> 00:05:01.561
&gt;&gt; WON'T CONTAIN COMMUNISM, IT

00:05:00.727 --> 00:05:05.598
WILL TRANSCEND COMMUNISM.

00:05:01.694 --> 00:05:08.334
&gt;&gt; WHEN I CAME IN IN 1982,

00:05:05.732 --> 00:05:11.538
REAGAN WAS STILL IN FULL

00:05:08.468 --> 00:05:12.071
THROATED DENUNCIATION OF THE

00:05:11.671 --> 00:05:13.673
SOVIET UNION.

00:05:12.205 --> 00:05:15.808
HE WAS STILL VERY MUCH PLAYING

00:05:13.806 --> 00:05:18.511
THE COLD WARRIOR.

00:05:15.942 --> 00:05:21.447
&gt;&gt; WHAT I'M STRIKE NOW IS A

00:05:18.645 --> 00:05:24.617
PLAN TO HOPE FOR THE LONG TERM,

00:05:21.581 --> 00:05:27.620
THE MARCH OF FREEDOM AND

00:05:24.751 --> 00:05:29.355
DEMOCRACY THAT WILL LEAVE

00:05:27.754 --> 00:05:31.391
MARXISM AND LENINISM.

00:05:29.489 --> 00:05:31.758
BRET: THE COLD WAR WAS

00:05:31.524 --> 00:05:33.092
WINNABLE.

00:05:31.891 --> 00:05:34.961
&gt;&gt; THERE WAS A HUGE ARGUMENT

00:05:33.226 --> 00:05:35.828
WITHIN THE ADMINISTRATION.

00:05:35.094 --> 00:05:38.364
PEOPLE IN THE DEFENSE

00:05:35.962 --> 00:05:39.499
DEPARTMENT AND THE CIA BOTH

00:05:38.498 --> 00:05:41.634
THOUGHT THE SOVIET UNION WAS

00:05:39.632 --> 00:05:43.236
THERE AT THE TIME.

00:05:41.768 --> 00:05:44.237
WE'RE HERE, THEY'RE THERE,

00:05:43.369 --> 00:05:44.871
THAT'S LIFE.

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:45.838
GET ALONG.

00:05:45.004 --> 00:05:47.874
&gt;&gt; THE AMERICAN PUBLIC SEEMED

00:05:45.972 --> 00:05:49.809
TO AGREE, NEARLY THREE QUARTERS

00:05:48.007 --> 00:05:50.810
FAVORED A NUCLEAR FREEZE BY THE

00:05:49.943 --> 00:05:53.213
UNITED STATES AND SOVIET UNION.

00:05:50.944 --> 00:05:56.115
&gt;&gt; I URGE YOU TO BEWARE THE

00:05:53.346 --> 00:05:57.884
TEMPTATION OF PRIDE, THE

00:05:56.249 --> 00:05:59.652
TEMPTATION OF BLITHELY,

00:05:58.017 --> 00:05:59.919
DECLARING YOURSELF ABOVE IT

00:05:59.786 --> 00:06:01.721
ALL.

00:06:00.053 --> 00:06:03.189
BRET: THAT SPARKED REAGAN'S

00:06:01.854 --> 00:06:04.090
MOST FORCEFUL CRITICISM EVER OF

00:06:03.323 --> 00:06:05.925
THE SOVIET UNION.

00:06:04.224 --> 00:06:07.694
&gt;&gt; TO IGNORE THE FACTS OF

00:06:06.059 --> 00:06:08.828
HISTORY AND AGGRESSIVE IMPULSES

00:06:07.827 --> 00:06:11.130
OF EVIL EMPIRE.

00:06:08.962 --> 00:06:13.099
TO CALL THE ARMS RACE A GIANT

00:06:11.264 --> 00:06:14.634
UNDERSTANDING AND THERE BY

00:06:13.233 --> 00:06:15.902
REMOVE YOURSELF FROM THE

00:06:14.767 --> 00:06:17.136
STRUGGLE BETWEEN RIGHT AND

00:06:16.035 --> 00:06:19.038
WRONG AND GOOD AND EVIL.

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:20.173
&gt;&gt; I WAS AT THE SPEECH WHERE HE

00:06:19.172 --> 00:06:22.375
TALKED ABOUT THE EVIL EMPIRE

00:06:20.306 --> 00:06:22.675
AND FOCUS OF EVIL IN THE MODERN

00:06:22.508 --> 00:06:24.611
WORLD.

00:06:22.809 --> 00:06:26.512
&gt;&gt; IT WAS STUNNING, EVEN BY

00:06:24.744 --> 00:06:27.547
REAGAN'S STANDARDS THAT WAS

00:06:26.646 --> 00:06:29.515
PRETTY BLUNT AND PRETTY RAW.

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:31.251
&gt;&gt; I REMEMBER JUST ASKING

00:06:29.649 --> 00:06:32.585
MYSELF AND MY STAFF SAY, YOU

00:06:31.384 --> 00:06:34.487
KNOW, WHAT DID REAGAN HAVE IN

00:06:32.719 --> 00:06:36.422
MIND WHEN HE CALLED THEM THE

00:06:34.621 --> 00:06:38.124
EVIL EMPIRE?

00:06:36.556 --> 00:06:39.726
IT WAS A PRETTY BRAZEN

00:06:38.258 --> 00:06:41.194
STATEMENT FOR A PRESIDENT TO

00:06:39.859 --> 00:06:43.062
MAKE ABOUT ANOTHER COUNTRY.

00:06:41.327 --> 00:06:45.431
AND WE JUST DECIDED THAT HE

00:06:43.196 --> 00:06:46.099
REALLY FELT HE COULD MAKE

00:06:45.565 --> 00:06:47.967
THINGS BETTER.

00:06:46.232 --> 00:06:49.335
&gt;&gt; RONALD REAGAN WANTED TO WIN

00:06:48.101 --> 00:06:51.504
THE COLD WAR FROM THE BEGINNING

00:06:49.469 --> 00:06:51.771
OF HIS TIME IN OFFICE TO THE

00:06:51.638 --> 00:06:55.208
END.

00:06:51.904 --> 00:06:56.676
&gt;&gt; YOU ONCE CALLED HIM A

00:06:55.341 --> 00:06:58.244
PRINCIPLED PRAGMATIST WHOSE

00:06:56.809 --> 00:06:59.946
STRONGEST SUIT IS KNOWING WHAT

00:06:58.378 --> 00:07:00.213
HE BELIEVED AND WHY HE BELIEVED

00:07:00.079 --> 00:07:01.414
IT.

00:07:00.346 --> 00:07:02.448
&gt;&gt; HE HAD A SYSTEM OF GOING

00:07:01.547 --> 00:07:04.250
ABOUT THINGS.

00:07:02.582 --> 00:07:05.985
NUMBER ONE, BE REALISTIC.

00:07:04.384 --> 00:07:07.520
NUMBER TWO, BE STRONG.

00:07:06.119 --> 00:07:08.921
NOT JUST MILITARY STRENGTH,

00:07:07.654 --> 00:07:10.189
ECONOMIC STRENGTH, BUT THEN

00:07:09.055 --> 00:07:11.758
MORE THAN THAT.

00:07:10.323 --> 00:07:13.259
HAVE STRENGTH AND PURPOSE.

00:07:11.891 --> 00:07:14.193
NUMBER THREE, FIGURE OUT WHAT

00:07:13.393 --> 00:07:17.163
IT IS THAT YOU WANT.

00:07:14.327 --> 00:07:19.232
WHEN YOU GET ALL THAT STRAIGHT.

00:07:17.297 --> 00:07:20.199
SIT DOWN AND NEGOTIATE AND YOU

00:07:19.365 --> 00:07:21.734
HAVE A HAND TO PLAY.

00:07:20.333 --> 00:07:24.604
BRET: BUT BEFORE REAGAN WAS

00:07:21.868 --> 00:07:27.307
READY TO PLAY THAT HAND, HE

